warning[short-circuit-statement]: `||` chain runs code as statement
 --> positive.jl:3:5
  |
3 |     n >= 0 || error("n must be non-negative")
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ hides `if`
  |
